+  whose pin records `lineage_sha256` as an invalid model plan; they cannot
+  `model rm` one, and one such model stops their `model list` and `lookaside
+  cache` for the whole store. They still read pulled, untrained, and
+  from-scratch models.
+- This WALDO reads and extends everything earlier versions wrote. Their
+  fine-tunes keep pins without lineage, and a compose an earlier version was
+  interrupted in pins lineage when this one makes the model.
+- A WALDO-format export copies `LINEAGE.json` unsigned; its signed `BOM.json`
+  pins the node hash that commits to it.
+- Nodes make it possible to tell where two models' histories meet, like
+  `git merge-base`; nothing walks them yet.
 
